3️⃣ String Interning & Immutability

Study
	•	Why string is immutable
	•	What happens with:

string s = "hello";
s += "world";

Try
string a = "test";
string b = "test";

Console.WriteLine(Object.ReferenceEquals(a, b));
Understand string pool.

